#: data/maps/Route114_LanettesHouse/scripts.inc:48
msgctxt "Route114_LanettesHouse_Text_EverythingClutteredKeepThis"
msgid ""
"LANETTE: Oh! {PLAYER}{KUN}!\p"
"I'm sorry everything is so cluttered…\n"
"When I get engrossed in research,\l"
"things end up this way…\p"
"This is embarrassing… Please keep\n"
"this a secret in exchange for this.$"
msgstr ""
"真由美：哦！{PLAYER}{KUN}！\p"
"不好意思，这里乱七八糟的……\n"
"我一专心做研究，就会变成这样……\p"
"真不好意思……这个给你，\n"
"请帮我保密哦。$"

#: data/maps/Route114_LanettesHouse/scripts.inc:56
msgctxt "Route114_LanettesHouse_Text_OrganizeYourBoxes"
msgid ""
"May I offer advice about my POKéMON\n"
"Storage System?\p"
"You should organize your BOXES so you\n"
"can tell which POKéMON are in them.$"
msgstr ""
"可以给你一些关于我的\n"
"宝可梦寄放系统的建议吗？\p"
"你应该好好整理盒子，这样就\n"
"能知道每个盒子里有哪些宝可梦了。$"

#: data/maps/Route114_LanettesHouse/scripts.inc:62
msgctxt "Route114_LanettesHouse_Text_ResearchNotesPage1"
msgid ""
"It's LANETTE's research notes.\n"
"There's information about BOXES.\p"
"Design BOXES to hold 30 POKéMON each.\p"
"Each TRAINER should be able to store\n"
"420 POKéMON on the PC system.\p"
"Keep reading?$"
msgstr ""
"这是真由美的研究笔记。\n"
"上面写着关于盒子的信息。\p"
"设计每个盒子可以存放30只宝可梦。\p"
"每位训练家应该能在\n"
"电脑系统中存放420只宝可梦。\p"
"要继续读下去吗？$"

#: data/maps/Route114_LanettesHouse/scripts.inc:70
msgctxt "Route114_LanettesHouse_Text_ResearchNotesPage2"
msgid ""
"A marking system should be added to\n"
"make POKéMON easier to organize.\p"
"The name and wallpaper design of each\n"
"BOX will be made changeable to please\l"
"the stored POKéMON.\p"
"Keep reading?$"
msgstr ""
"应该加入标记功能，\n"
"让宝可梦更容易整理。\p"
"为了让存放的宝可梦开心，\n"
"每个盒子的名字和壁纸都可以更改。\p"
"要继续读下去吗？$"

#: data/maps/Route114_LanettesHouse/scripts.inc:78
msgctxt "Route114_LanettesHouse_Text_ResearchNotesPage3"
msgid ""
"When storing a POKéMON, it should be\n"
"sent to the BOX inspected last.\p"
"If that BOX is full, the received\n"
"POKéMON is stored in the next BOX.\p"
"In other words, when a BOX is examined,\n"
"it is automatically selected as the BOX\l"
"to which POKéMON are sent.$"
msgstr ""
"存放宝可梦时，\n"
"应该把它送到最后查看的那个盒子里。\p"
"如果那个盒子满了，就把收到的\n"
"宝可梦存放到下一个盒子里。\p"
"换句话说，查看过的盒子会被\n"
"自动选为宝可梦的存放盒子。$"

#: data/maps/Route114_LanettesHouse/scripts.inc:87
msgctxt "Route114_LanettesHouse_Text_ClosedTheNotebook"
msgid "{PLAYER} closed the notebook.$"
msgstr "{PLAYER}合上了笔记本。$"

#: data/maps/Route114_LanettesHouse/scripts.inc:90
msgctxt "Route114_LanettesHouse_Text_EmailFromBill"
msgid ""
"There's an e-mail from someone on\n"
"the PC.\p"
"“… … … … … … …\p"
"“Your Storage System offers more\n"
"convenience than mine.\p"
"“It has a lot of user-friendly features\n"
"that make it fun and useful, too.\p"
"“It makes me proud that I played\n"
"a part in its development.\p"
"“Here's hoping that you'll continue\n"
"research in Storage Systems.\p"
"“From BILL\n"
"… … … … … … … …”$"
msgstr ""
"电脑里有一封某人发来的电子邮件。\p"
"“…… …… …… …… …… …… ……\p"
"“你的寄放系统比我的更方便。\p"
"“它有很多好用的功能，既有趣又实用。\p"
"“能参与它的开发，我感到很自豪。\p"
"“希望你能继续进行寄放系统的研究。\p"
"“正辉 …… …… …… ……\n"
" …… …… …… ……”$"
